@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title OpenData Version 2.0.0 System Context
left to right direction
actor "Operator / External Scheduler" as Operator
rectangle "OpenData Java Application" as App
file "Bootstrap and Override Properties" as Config
cloud "Ofgem" as Ofgem
cloud "Open-Meteo" as Meteo
folder "Octopus Statement PDFs" as Octopus
folder "Work, Archive and Logs" as Files
database "OpenData SQL Server\nconfiguration, audit and plugin data" as Database

Operator --> App : CLI command
App --> Config : read / bootstrap rewrite
App --> Ofgem : HTTPS page and XLSX
App --> Meteo : HTTPS JSON API
App --> Octopus : read local PDFs
App --> Database : pooled JDBC
App --> Files : work, archive and logs
@enduml
